if {Interaction} == 1.0:
	VO: I helped Noah design this poster.
	VO: should I be getting a cut of the profits?
elif {Interaction} == 2.0:
	VO: I wonder how many people hired him after seeing this.
	VO: and how many of those people had random machine scrap around?
