	VO: Help! Trapped in a time loop!
	VO: he'd probably do it.
elif {Interaction} == 6.0:
	VO: we're really in it now, poster Noah.
elif {Interaction} == 7.0:
	VO: I think I'm finding a new appreciation for art.
	VO: I'm starting to warm up to the comic sans.
elif {Interaction} == 8.0:
	VO: see ya around poster noah.